716
00:30:38,610 --> 00:30:41,010
because, to build on Chancellor Christian's vision

717
00:30:41,010 --> 00:30:43,260
on providing internships for everybody,

718
00:30:43,260 --> 00:30:46,080
but in addition we'll give them CMO services,

719
00:30:46,080 --> 00:30:49,860
chief marketing officer services, CTO Services,

720
00:30:49,860 --> 00:30:52,470
chief financial officer Services.

721
00:30:52,470 --> 00:30:55,433
Because anybody can have an idea,

722
00:30:55,433 --> 00:30:56,970
but it is so hard to think about

723
00:30:56,970 --> 00:31:00,180
how to take that idea and make it real.

724
00:31:00,180 --> 00:31:04,020
So check out Quantum Leap and check out the information.

725
00:31:04,020 --> 00:31:06,090
And thank you so much for your time.

