and that would be my career.

935
00:41:42,150 --> 00:41:45,960
And so I graduated college, I moved to San Francisco,

936
00:41:45,960 --> 00:41:49,500
I joined a startup in the Valley.

937
00:41:49,500 --> 00:41:52,890
And very quickly, I'd like to say,

938
00:41:52,890 --> 00:41:55,530
I received an education on what Silicon Valley

939
00:41:55,530 --> 00:41:58,500
