being driven in this geography

942
00:42:03,840 --> 00:42:06,420
was producing profitable technologies

943
00:42:06,420 --> 00:42:10,170
but not technologies that benefit society.

944
00:42:10,170 --> 00:42:11,130
And increasingly,

945
00:42:11,130 --> 00:42:13,500
because I joined the tech industry in 2015,

946
00:42:13,500 --> 00:42:16,020
increasingly we were starting to realize

947
00:42:16,020 --> 00:42:19,800
that not only were they not necessarily benefiting society,

948
00:42:19,800 --> 00:42:22,680
but in fact, in many ways, harming society.

949
00:42:22,680 --> 00:42:26,220
This was right as Trump 1.0 was about to happen,

950
00:42:26,220 --> 00:42:29,400
Cambridge Analytica revelations were about to happen.

951
00:42:29,400 --> 00:42:34,200
