00:44:28,890 --> 00:44:32,010
and how we speak to each other and how we move politically,

991
00:44:32,010 --> 00:44:36,690
but also the entire supply chain

992
00:44:36,690 --> 00:44:38,880
of exploitation that happens

993
00:44:38,880 --> 00:44:41,880
in order to make these technologies available.

994
00:44:41,880 --> 00:44:43,620
So I just wanna get right into it.

995
00:44:43,620 --> 00:44:46,323
I mean, in the book,

996
00:44:47,765 --> 00:44:51,030
you know, you covered this arc from kind of Sam Altman,

