00:45:14,340 --> 00:45:17,430
like were most important you wanted people to understand

1006
00:45:17,430 --> 00:45:18,930
as you were writing this book?

1007
00:45:20,670 --> 00:45:23,040
- Part of the reason I started working on this book,

1008
00:45:23,040 --> 00:45:26,700
so I've been covering AI since 2017, 2018

1009
00:45:26,700 --> 00:45:28,830
and I had been tracking OpenAI

1010
00:45:28,830 --> 00:45:32,250
specifically as a company since 2019.

1011
00:45:32,250 --> 00:45:34,890
And when ChatGPT came out

1012
00:45:34,890 --> 00:45:39,060
and suddenly the world was talking about AI,

1013
00:45:39,060 --> 00:45:41,550
I was honestly a little bit disappointed

1014
00:45:41,550 --> 00:45:44,040
because I felt like the conversation had,

1015
00:45:44,040 --> 00:45:46,230
there was like amnesia, everything reset,

1016
00:45:46,230 --> 00:45:48,720
all of the work that people

1017
00:45:48,720 --> 00:45:50,640
within our community of AI accountability

1018
00:45:50,640 --> 00:45:52,860
have been doing for years at that point,

1019
00:45:52,860 --> 00:45:56,070
talking about the challenges and harms of AI,

1020
00:45:56,070 --> 00:45:58,860
had kind of been erased and rewritten

1021
00:45:58,860 --> 00:46:00,900
to only have narratives

1022
00:46:00,900 --> 00:46:02,340
that Silicon Valley was trying to install

1023
00:46:02,340 --> 00:46:03,930
into the public understanding of this technology,

1024
00:46:03,930 --> 00:46:05,340
that it's just going to be beneficial,

1025
00:46:05,340 --> 00:46:06,840
it's just gonna bring the future.

1026
00:46:06,840 --> 00:46:09,690
And Altman was the embodiment of that.

1027
00:46:09,690 --> 00:46:13,320
And he was like such a good prophet for the moment

1028
00:46:13,320 --> 00:46:17,160
in that he seemed very different from Mark Zuckerberg.

1029
00:46:17,160 --> 00:46:20,283
You know, he was coming onto stages in front of congress,

1030
00:46:21,210 --> 00:46:23,520
in front of conferences like this

1031
00:46:23,520 --> 00:46:25,357
being the kind of aw-shucks guy like,

1032
00:46:25,357 --> 00:46:27,330
"I didn't intentionally become

