00:46:27,330 --> 00:46:29,910
the most powerful man in the world, whoopsies.

1034
00:46:29,910 --> 00:46:31,170
I didn't want this role.

1035
00:46:31,170 --> 00:46:32,850
And this technology that I'm building

1036
00:46:32,850 --> 00:46:34,560
is totally different from social media.

1037
00:46:34,560 --> 00:46:38,430
And we're not gonna repeat those mistakes.

1038
00:46:38,430 --> 00:46:40,590
We're like right side by side with you.

1039
00:46:40,590 --> 00:46:43,767
We're gonna walk you gently into the future."

1040
00:46:44,670 --> 00:46:46,410
And yeah, I was really frustrated

1041
00:46:46,410 --> 00:46:49,110
'cause I was like, "Actually, Altman is,"

1042
00:46:49,110 --> 00:46:51,090
he's such a product to Silicon Valley,

